      384.0,
      310.09,
      440.39
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that theGovernment intended to acquire the following land for a publicpurpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
